  "scope": "Arbitrary specified same-order contractions before and after an actual RV graph refinement have common forward original-Gamma volume blowups on their retained-density normalized outputs. Two specified VF2 contraction orders reduce to actual contractions of one common cell family in one genuine context. UniformMixedCellPresentation retains the actual global positioning map; its graph-refinement centre has a full original-Gamma graph and is constant on frozen VF/RV fibres. The whole-family vertical translation is bijective, original-Gamma, head-saturated and VF-Jacobian-one almost everywhere, and its image has an actual standard contraction. Relative translation comparisons now allow arbitrary mixed RV labels and every positive VF degree. Pointwise actual RV-labelled cell fibres compare in their genuine small name contexts. These are reductions and uniform vertical geometry, not the global opposite-order volume comparison for a complete cell family. The compatible horizontal/product family comparison and global RV Jacobian, higher-dimensional exchange and7.8-7.15 remain open.",
